Package: aqEthnicity
Type: Package
Title: Race and Ethnicity Probabilities from Names and Places (Hosted STRATA Client)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Terry", "Leitch", email = "terry@aequum.ai", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("aequumAI LLC", role = c("cph", "fnd")))
Description: A client for the hosted 'aqEthnicity' service. It estimates race and
    ethnicity probabilities for groups of people from a surname, a first name and a
    place: Bayesian Improved Surname Geocoding (BISG) and its first-name extension
    (BIFSG), the 'STRATA' name-and-address model with an uncertainty index, and an
    address geocoding check. Requests are columnar and batched, and
    'predict_race_aq()' returns a data frame with 'wru'-style probability columns.
    Results are statistical estimates for populations, not statements about any
    individual. An API key is required; see the README.
